cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the result catalogs, please cite this repository."
title: "exo-spectra: homogeneous consistency and anomaly catalogs for published exoplanet spectra"
authors:
  - family-names: "Godala"
    given-names: "Mateusz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Exo-Spectra/exo-spectra"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - transmission spectroscopy
  - atmospheric variability
  - anomaly detection
  - NASA Exoplanet Archive
abstract: >
  Homogeneous statistical analysis of all published exoplanet atmospheric
  spectra in the NASA Exoplanet Archive: (1) an archive-wide catalog of
  epoch-to-epoch consistency tests (chi-squared with free offset/slope,
  false-discovery-rate control, pair provenance classification), and
  (2) a model-independent anomaly search (per-spectrum structure tests,
  PCA shape outliers within instrument cohorts, and a point-anomaly catalog
  with instrument hotspot maps).
